      "text": "从共享内存取数\n并在寄存器内完成计算",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "从共享内存取数\n并在寄存器内完成计算",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bz_kcluOKY8WTlXX9sbWe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1991.1844298730966,
      "y": 289.21676742413626,
      "width": 200.6599884033203,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 483526392,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1060316920,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**每步（k 固定）：**",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**每步（k 固定）：**",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Eu-RvptbVlwLBjo-HOyOw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1848.6645095239755,
      "y": 359.21676742413626,
      "width": 485.6998291015625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1450181768,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1580262536,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 从 Ads 取 **a[8]**（当前 k 列的 8 行）→ 寄存器",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 从 Ads 取 **a[8]**（当前 k 列的 8 行）→ 寄存器",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "No50VfLGynp1OChL6fzDB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1848.024494875538,
      "y": 394.21676742413626,
      "width": 486.9798583984375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 199649272,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 86214648,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 从 Bds 取 **b[8]**（当前 k 行的 8 列）→ 寄存器",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 从 Bds 取 **b[8]**（当前 k 行的 8 列）→ 寄存器",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PMUNMH1VrFC_9LZhegCLy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1899.804524172413,
      "y": 429.21676742413626,
      "width": 383.4197998046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1510880136,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1991447432,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 寄存器内外积：`acc[i][j] += a[i]*b[j]`",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 寄存器内外积：`acc[i][j] += a[i]*b[j]`",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PwkGXOVIvs5je71am7Ff2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1855.1744582544443,
      "y": 499.21676742413626,
      "width": 472.679931640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002875128,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1348454648,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129971,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**沿 K 步进 32 次**，acc 不断叠加，最后写回 C。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**沿 K 步进 32 次**，acc 不断叠加，最后写回 C。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vQqXHJhPYJ5DL8O0dDnGO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1694.8945510278818,
      "y": 556.7167674241363,
      "width": 793.23974609375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 90,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1208910472,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 1024942728,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792139151511,
      "created": 1792139129972,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**寄存器账：** a [8]+b [8]+acc [64] = 80 个 float，每步只加载 16 个数，做 64 次\n乘加。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**寄存器账：** a [8]+b [8]+acc [64] = 80 个 float，每步只加载 16 个数，做 64 次乘加。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aJuwCMwMIIlImahpZ62sO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1326.0716465541295,
      "y": 344.99996185302734,
      "width": 365.00164531958603,
      "height": 169.2753180844565,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
